    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d377">

                <pb facs="0437" n="1171" xml:id="pg1171"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-07-20"><hi rendition="#italic">July 20,
                        1895</hi>.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Mora matter awaiting final action council of state. Important to settle currency
                    question before it acts. Government perfectly able to make gold payment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Taylor.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
